#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:18
#: 396773ca851249658fca9165bd0b6fe0
msgid ""
"Shared xacro: [`simulation_hardware.xacro`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot-descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/xacro/ros2_control/simulation_hardware.xacro)."
" `hardware:=isaac` writes `/isaac/joint_command` and "
"`/isaac/joint_states`. `hardware:=isaac_sim` writes `<param "
"name=\"prim_path\">` from launch `isaac_prim_path` (ArticulationRoot). "
"[`robot_common_launch` README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/README.md) lists both "
"keys. `use_sim_time` is true for `gz`, `isaac`, and `isaac_sim` unless "
"the launch argument is explicitly `true` or `false` "
"([`launch_arg_utils.py`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/robot_common_launch/common/launch_arg_utils.py))."
msgstr ""
"共享 xacro：[`simulation_hardware.xacro`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/robot-descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/xacro/ros2_control/simulation_hardware.xacro)。`hardware:=isaac`"
" 写入 `/isaac/joint_command` 和 `/isaac/joint_states`。`hardware:=isaac_sim` "
"从启动参数 `isaac_prim_path`（ArticulationRoot）写入 `<param "
"name=\"prim_path\">`。[`robot_common_launch` README](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/README.md) "
"列出了这两个键。`gz`、`isaac`、`isaac_sim` 的 `use_sim_time` 为 true，除非启动参数显式写成 "
"`true` 或 `false`（[`launch_arg_utils.py`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/robot-descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/robot_common_launch/common/launch_arg_utils.py)）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:20
#: 3c95ae98d36f423c9a20be39dbaff416
msgid ""
"A robot xacro that whitelists `validated_hardware_type` must include "
"`isaac_sim` or that xacro fails on purpose."
msgstr ""
"若机器人 xacro 白名单了 `validated_hardware_type`，必须包含 `isaac_sim`，否则该 xacro "
"会故意失败。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:22
#: dba4d4055b86440c92b48f426dc599fa
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`{hardware}.yaml` overlays merge only when the file exists. "
"`load_robot_config` order is common → type yaml → `{variant}.yaml` → end-"
"effector compose → `{hardware}.yaml` → `control.patch` "
"([`robot_utils.py`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/robot_common_launch/common/robot_utils.py))."
" Hardware overlay runs after compose so a later compose pass does not "
"drop gripper keys from `isaac.yaml` ([robot-descriptions-common "
"#41](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-common/pull/41))."
" `isaac_sim` can reuse `isaac.yaml`; emit passes `hardware_yaml=isaac`. A"
" file named `isaac_sim.yaml` is loaded when the launch hardware string is"
" `isaac_sim`."
msgstr ""
"`{hardware}.yaml` 仅在文件存在时合并。`load_robot_config` 的顺序是 common → 类型 yaml → "
"`{variant}.yaml` → 末端执行器组合 → `{hardware}.yaml` → "
"`control.patch`（[`robot_utils.py`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/robot_common_launch/common/robot_utils.py)）。硬件覆盖在组合之后，后面的组合步骤不会丢掉"
" `isaac.yaml` 里的夹爪键（[robot-descriptions-common #41](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-common/pull/41)）。`isaac_sim` 可以复用 "
"`isaac.yaml`；emit 传入 `hardware_yaml=isaac`。当启动的硬件字符串是 `isaac_sim` 时，会加载名为"
" `isaac_sim.yaml` 的文件。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:24
