#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:26
#: b20d1bdacb4d4be3ad01ab23b080488e
msgid ""
"The shared macro’s `/isaac/joint_*` pair is the topic-bridge default "
"(Acone uses that macro). W2’s topic-bridge graph publishes "
"`/joint_command` and `/joint_states` ([`ros2.usda`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/fiveages-gen2-robot-"
"usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/ros2.usda)). The xacro `<param>` and the "
"graph `topicName` are the same strings. `demo.launch.py` does not take a "
"namespace that rewrites them."
msgstr ""
"共享宏的 `/isaac/joint_*` 一对是话题桥默认值（Acone 用这个宏）。W2 的话题桥图发布 `/joint_command` 和"
" `/joint_states`（[`ros2.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fiveages-"
"gen2-robot-usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/ros2.usda)）。xacro 的 `<param>` "
"和图的 `topicName` 是同一组字符串。`demo.launch.py` 没有能改写它们的命名空间参数。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:28
#: e5f9ad7abdc84480a60c8a2de91b701d
msgid ""
"In-process W2 ([`fiveages.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/fiveages-gen2-robot-usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/fiveages.usda)) does "
"not bridge body or arm `JointState` topics. The controller manager owns "
"those degrees of freedom. Chassis `cmd_vel` / `odom` stay on the child "
"ROS graph."
msgstr ""
"进程内 W2（[`fiveages.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fiveages-gen2"
"-robot-usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/fiveages.usda)）不桥接身体或手臂的 "
"`JointState` 话题。这些自由度归控制器管理器。底盘的 `cmd_vel` / `odom` 留在子 ROS 图上。"

