#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:45
#: 63205b39d102436192a2b13b7ebe71fd
msgid ""
"`emit_control` builds one xacro URDF and pins both the controller manager"
" and `/robot_description` to it. `Ros2ControlManager.setup` is called "
"with `publish_robot_description=False`, so the manager does not publish "
"that topic again. `robot_state_publisher` (host process) publishes "
"`/robot_description` and the URDF TF tree. If that process does not "
"start, a latched `fasim_robot_description` publisher is the fallback. "
"Resource Manager therefore loads the description once."
msgstr ""
"`emit_control` 生成一份 xacro URDF，并把控制器管理器和 `/robot_description` "
"都钉在它上面。`Ros2ControlManager.setup` 以 `publish_robot_description=False` "
"调用，因此管理器不会再发这个话题。`robot_state_publisher`（宿主机进程）发布 `/robot_description` 和 "
"URDF 的 TF 树。若该进程没起来，回退是锁存的 `fasim_robot_description` 发布者。资源管理器因此只加载一次描述。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:47
#: c48d65450e85491b803ddc039a8f4bb0
msgid ""
"That xacro path is also why Play does not synthesize a fresh URDF from "
"the stage on every start: the node reuses the description xacro and only "
"falls back to USD synthesis for an unexpected prim."
msgstr "也正因为走这条 xacro，播放时不会每次从舞台重新合成一份 URDF：节点复用描述 xacro，只在遇到意外图元时才回退到 USD 合成。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:49
#: 9655b69ace2d45f48d8fb4c970b7221d
msgid "CppAD cache"
msgstr "CppAD 缓存"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:51
#: e6e3c839b32e431c89d92472ba9f3956
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`ocs2_arm_controller` declares `recompile_libraries` with default "
"**true** when `task.info` does not set `recompileLibraries` "
"([`CtrlComponent.h`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/include/ocs2_arm_controller/control/CtrlComponent.h))."
" The library folder is "
"`${OCS2_PLANNING_URDF_DIR:-/tmp}/ocs2_ros2/<robot>/ocs2/<content-hash>`."
msgstr ""
"`ocs2_arm_controller` 声明 `recompile_libraries`，当 `task.info` 没有设置 "
"`recompileLibraries` 时默认 **true**（[`CtrlComponent.h`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/include/ocs2_arm_controller/control/CtrlComponent.h)）。库目录是"
" `${OCS2_PLANNING_URDF_DIR:-/tmp}/ocs2_ros2/<robot>/ocs2/<content-hash>`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:53
#: 2f4e210903654dbe8d3270d78105c0ef
msgid ""
"`emit_control` then sets `recompile_libraries: false` on the **main** "
"controller only: `ocs2_arm_controller` for `demo` / `split_body`, "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller` for `full_body`. That force applies to the in-"
"process `isaac_sim` path. A topic-bridge `hardware:=isaac` launch does "
"not run `emit_control`, so it keeps the controller default (true unless "
"that robot’s info or YAML already says false)."
msgstr ""
"`emit_control` 接着只把**主**控制器的 `recompile_libraries` 设为 false：`demo` / "
"`split_body` 是 `ocs2_arm_controller`，`full_body` 是 "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller`。这次强制只作用于进程内 `isaac_sim`。话题桥的 `hardware:=isaac` 启动不跑"
" `emit_control`，因此保留控制器默认值（true，除非该机器人的 info 或 YAML 已经写成 false）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:55
#: f9e51420a28347619f16678ebdf1f3c4
msgid ""
"Reusing the xacro URDF and reusing the CppAD cache are the two startup "
"shortcuts for a simulated robot that runs 运控 inside Isaac."
msgstr "复用 xacro URDF 和复用 CppAD 缓存，是仿真机器人在 Isaac 里跑运控时的两项启动加速。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:57
#: 1b3121de271140bb938b3b0d786c7599
msgid "`infoFile` and `BASE_LOCK`"
msgstr "`infoFile` 与 `BASE_LOCK`"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:59
#: 4e70afe87b62425cb579e3fcfcdfdfe4
msgid ""
"`infoFile` overrides `info_file_name` on the main controller. "
"`fixed_base_tcp` drops the virtual chassis degrees of freedom "
"(`manipulatorModelType` 0) so whole-body planning is body and arms."
msgstr ""
"`infoFile` 覆盖主控制器的 `info_file_name`。`fixed_base_tcp` "
"去掉虚拟底盘自由度（`manipulatorModelType` 0），全身规划只含身体和手臂。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:61
#: f5256f78d9994b0bae343d1cca7ab63f
msgid ""
"`emit_control` warns when `mode` is `full_body` and the override name "
"contains `fixed_base`: the planner has `basePlan=0`, so a runtime "
"`BASE_LOCK` has nothing to constrain, and the arm enable policy can stay "
"in `WAITING_FOR_ENABLE_POLICY`. Locking the base uses `mobile_base_tcp` "
"plus `BASE_LOCK`."
msgstr ""
"当 `mode` 为 `full_body` 且覆盖名含 `fixed_base` 时，`emit_control` 会警告：规划器 "
"`basePlan=0`，运行时的 `BASE_LOCK` 没有可约束的量，手臂使能策略可能停在 "
"`WAITING_FOR_ENABLE_POLICY`。锁底盘用 `mobile_base_tcp` 加 `BASE_LOCK`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:63
#: 03630ed81d1d4030ae8f2dacc3e24ecc
msgid ""
"Whole-body control needs [ocs2-wbc-controller](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/ocs2-wbc-controller) (private; open it after access)."
msgstr ""
"全身控制需要 [ocs2-wbc-controller](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/ocs2-wbc-"
"controller)（私有；开通后打开）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:65
#: 063e6171adf4462d8c2a8fb2f8d66a14
msgid "Clock"
msgstr "Clock"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:67
#: 4526e9455929483cbb7d749ecac6bdec
msgid ""
"In-process W2 publishes `/clock` from a separate on-demand graph "
"`ROS_Clock`: `evaluationMode=OnDemand`, "
"`pipelineStage=pipelineStageOnDemand`, `OnPhysicsStep` → `PublishClock`, "
"`IsaacReadSimulationTime` with `resetOnStop=1` "
"([`fiveages.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fiveages-gen2-robot-"
"usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/fiveages.usda)). `OnPhysicsStep` does not "
"run in the automatic `ROS_Control` graph, so the clock graph stays beside"
" it. `ROS_Control` still uses `OnPlaybackTick` to start "
"`ROS2ControlLaunch` once."
msgstr ""
"进程内 W2 用单独的按需图 `ROS_Clock` 发布 "
"`/clock`：`evaluationMode=OnDemand`，`pipelineStage=pipelineStageOnDemand`，`OnPhysicsStep`"
" → `PublishClock`，`IsaacReadSimulationTime` 的 "
"`resetOnStop=1`（[`fiveages.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/fiveages-gen2-robot-"
"usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/fiveages.usda)）。`OnPhysicsStep` 不会在自动的 "
"`ROS_Control` 图里跑，所以时钟图放在旁边。`ROS_Control` 仍用 `OnPlaybackTick` 把 "
"`ROS2ControlLaunch` 启动一次。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:69
#: 26c46ee9a5b14eecbe36a9437efa7c9b
msgid ""
"The topic-bridge payload on the same robot "
"([`ros2.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fiveages-gen2-robot-"
"usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/ros2.usda)) still drives `PublishClock` "
"from `OnPlaybackTick` and sets `resetOnStop=0`."
msgstr ""
"同一台机器人的话题桥载荷（[`ros2.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fiveages-gen2"
"-robot-usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/ros2.usda)）仍从 `OnPlaybackTick` 驱动 "
"`PublishClock`，并把 `resetOnStop` 设为 0。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:71
#: b36c6a79eaac495cb19a3d0332fd8ee6
msgid ""
"`/clock` is the controller’s time base when `use_sim_time` is true. A "
"render-frame clock advances several physics steps in one tick, so a timed"
" move finishes early. The repair is the physics-step clock, not a joint-"
"parameter change. The same `ROS_Clock` pattern is what new fiveages in-"
"process payloads follow; this page verifies it on W2. Odometry graphs "
"keep their own `ReadSimTime` (`resetOnStop=1`) so `odom` stamps stay "
"valid. Camera prims belong on the scene payload, not on this clock graph."
msgstr ""
"`use_sim_time` 为 true 时，`/clock` "
"是控制器的时间基准。渲染帧时钟会在一个节拍里推进好几个物理步，于是限时运动提前结束。修的是物理步时钟，而不是关节参数。新的 fiveages "
"进程内载荷也跟这套 `ROS_Clock`；本页在 W2 上核对过。里程计图保留自己的 "
"`ReadSimTime`（`resetOnStop=1`），这样 `odom` 时间戳仍然有效。相机图元放在场景载荷上，不放在这张时钟图上。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:73
#: aae16aa6d37c41da96b19915fe94f62c
msgid ""
"`arms_target_manager`, when the node spawns it, is a host process with "
"`use_sim_time:=false` so markers are not tied to the physics step."
msgstr "节点若拉起 `arms_target_manager`，它是宿主机进程，`use_sim_time:=false`，标记不跟物理步绑定。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:75
#: 8a62d92fd7cb434db4d12b6e4c1e6aa4
msgid "TF"
msgstr "TF"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:77
#: 533ddb7744d947f199c52ba1570bb180
msgid ""
"Isaac’s odometry graph publishes `world → odom → base_*` and `/odom`. It "
"does not publish the whole URDF tree. `robot_state_publisher` publishes "
"`base_footprint → base_link` (when both links exist) and the arm tree, "
"including fixed frames such as `right_eef`."
msgstr ""
"Isaac 的里程计图发布 `world → odom → base_*` 和 `/odom`。它不发布整棵 URDF "
"树。`robot_state_publisher` 发布 `base_footprint → "
"base_link`（两个连杆都存在时）以及手臂树，包括 `right_eef` 这类固定帧。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:79
#: 39ac1bc5fafe40ee8def356db84a68f3
msgid ""
"W2’s in-process ArticulationRoot is `base_link` "
"(`/FiveAges_W2/base_link`). The odometry chain on that payload is `world "
"→ odom → base_footprint`; `robot_state_publisher` publishes "
"`base_footprint → base_link`. OCS2 `baseFrame` is the same link the "
"planner’s `task.info` names. `base_footprint` is the ground link; "
"`base_link` may sit above it. Two publishers on one edge fight. A "
"standing model with no `base_footprint` uses `base_link` for that chain. "
"Confirm the link in that robot’s USD and `task.info` before copying the "
"W2 names."
msgstr ""
"W2 进程内的 ArticulationRoot 是 "
"`base_link`（`/FiveAges_W2/base_link`）。该载荷上的里程计链是 `world → odom → "
"base_footprint`；`robot_state_publisher` 发布 `base_footprint → "
"base_link`。OCS2 的 `baseFrame` 就是规划器 `task.info` 点名的那个连杆。`base_footprint` "
"是贴地连杆；`base_link` 可以高出地面。一条边两个发布者会抢。没有 `base_footprint` 的站立模型用 "
"`base_link` 接这条链。抄 W2 的名字之前，先在该机器人的 USD 和 `task.info` 里核对连杆。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:81
#: 2bb160eb89c84d6b929a1e0475b165bf
msgid "Several robots"
msgstr "多台机器人"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:83
#: b8c60e01ed564a5ea38ddd2a57efad24
msgid ""
"One ArticulationRoot, one `ROS2ControlLaunch`, and one controller manager"
" per robot. Isolation is the graph `namespace` plus relative topic names "
"(`cmd_vel`, `fsm_command`, `robot_description`). `/clock` stays global."
msgstr ""
"每台机器人一个 ArticulationRoot、一个 `ROS2ControlLaunch`、一个控制器管理器。隔离靠图的 "
"`namespace` 加上相对话题名（`cmd_vel`、`fsm_command`、`robot_description`）。`/clock`"
" 保持全局。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:85
#: 53907df20ae048f297f6b7175308625d
msgid ""
"A ROS namespace remaps topics (`/<ns>/tf`, `/<ns>/tf_static`). It does "
"not prefix `frame_id`. Each tree still has frames named `world`, `odom`, "
"and `base_link`. `world → odom` is that robot’s latched spawn pose on "
"**its** `/<ns>/tf`, not a rewritten frame called `g1d/world`. RViz "
"listens to `/tf` unless you remap it, for example:"
msgstr ""
"ROS 命名空间会重映射话题（`/<ns>/tf`、`/<ns>/tf_static`）。它不会给 `frame_id` "
"加前缀。每棵树里的帧名仍是 `world`、`odom` 和 `base_link`。`world → odom` 是这台机器人在**自己的** "
"`/<ns>/tf` 上锁存的出生位姿，不是改名为 `g1d/world` 的帧。RViz 默认听 `/tf`，需要时再重映射，例如："

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:87
#: 84e77eda599f4430905ff8d19a331225
msgid ""
"ros2 run tf2_ros tf2_echo world base_link --ros-args \\\n"
"  -r /tf:=/<ns>/tf -r /tf_static:=/<ns>/tf_static"
msgstr ""
"ros2 run tf2_ros tf2_echo world base_link --ros-args \\\n"
"  -r /tf:=/<ns>/tf -r /tf_static:=/<ns>/tf_static"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:92
#: dac62aef54504ab493c799b5af25a41e
msgid ""
"`<ns>` is the string on that graph’s `namespace` input, not a "
"`demo.launch.py` argument. A stage with one graph and one controller "
"manager per robot has been run."
msgstr ""
"`<ns>` 是该图 `namespace` 输入上的字符串，不是 `demo.launch.py` "
"的参数。一个舞台、每台机器人一张图和一个控制器管理器，已经跑通过。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:94
#: 6807b08c51f541f49911861f82c3b9f6
msgid "Navigation"
msgstr "Navigation"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:96
#: 9c82e9c7d7e440bea3494c5ed8f87695
msgid ""
"`NavigationLaunch` ([`OgnNavigationLaunch.ogn`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac/blob/main/exts/fasim.ros2.nodes/fasim/ros2/nodes/ogn/python/nodes/OgnNavigationLaunch.ogn))"
" starts `ros2 launch robot_common_launch navigation_isaac_gt.launch.py` "
"on Play when `enabled` is true. W2’s fiveages graph leaves `enabled` "
"false."
msgstr ""
"`NavigationLaunch`（[`OgnNavigationLaunch.ogn`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac/blob/main/exts/fasim.ros2.nodes/fasim/ros2/nodes/ogn/python/nodes/OgnNavigationLaunch.ogn)）在"
" `enabled` 为 true 时，于播放后启动 `ros2 launch robot_common_launch "
"navigation_isaac_gt.launch.py`。W2 的 fiveages 图把 `enabled` 留为 false。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:98
#: b763c8cbe549495aa49268d9b0f2b6df
msgid ""
"`map` and `paramsFile` are paths relative to the opened stage root, so an"
" `env/` layer can point at `../../maps/<name>/map.yaml` stored in the "
"same [fa-project-usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-project-usd) "
"project. The node does not call composer `ros2-stack`. Default "
"`nav2Profile` is `map_only`. `publishMapWorldTf` defaults true (map drawn"
" in USD world). `publishMapOdomTf` defaults false because odometry comes "
"from Isaac."
msgstr ""
"`map` 和 `paramsFile` 相对已打开的舞台根解析，因此 `env/` 层可以指向同一 [fa-project-"
"usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-project-usd) 项目里的 "
"`../../maps/<name>/map.yaml`。该节点不调用编排器的 `ros2-stack`。默认 `nav2Profile` 是 "
"`map_only`。`publishMapWorldTf` 默认 true（地图画在 USD 世界里）。`publishMapOdomTf` "
"默认 false，因为里程计来自 Isaac。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:100
#: b4fa312c38d142b7a3bc918d6306482b
msgid "Project scenes"
msgstr "项目场景"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:102
#: 630086b536694d4ab497fe286b8d14fb
msgid ""
"[fa-project-usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-project-usd) is "
"private. On `main`, a project is `scene.usd(a)`, `objects/`, and runnable"
" `env/` ([README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-project-"
"usd/blob/main/README.md))."
msgstr ""
"[fa-project-usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-project-usd) 是私有仓库。在 "
"`main` 上，一个项目是 `scene.usd(a)`、`objects/` 和可运行的 "
"`env/`（[README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-project-"
"usd/blob/main/README.md)）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:104
#: e88786b0fbcb4cd198461943d13ac3d0
msgid ""
"Orchestration files next to those scenes (`robot.yaml`, `task_configs/`, "
"`maps/` or `map/`) are on branch `feature/sinopec-test-tube-picking`, "
"which is ahead of `main` and not merged (compared 2026-11-13). Three "
"projects on that branch have this layout: `Fiveages/2026-11 Standard "
"Moving Boxes`, `Siemens/2026-06 Wind Turbine Blade Detection`, and "
"`Aimbo/2026-04 Bosch German&Poland POC`. Open the branch after you have "
"access. The public entry for running a project directory is [lerobot_ros2"
" `examples/IsaacSim/README.md`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/lerobot_ros2/blob/main/examples/IsaacSim/README.md) (`motion-"
"generation` with `LEROBOT_ROOT` set). Camera rigs stay in the scene USD."
msgstr ""
"这些场景旁边的编排文件（`robot.yaml`、`task_configs/`、`maps/` 或 `map/`）在分支 `feature"
"/sinopec-test-tube-picking` 上，该分支领先 `main` 且尚未合入（2026-11-13 "
"对比）。该分支上有这份布局的三个项目：`Fiveages/2026-11 Standard Moving "
"Boxes`、`Siemens/2026-06 Wind Turbine Blade Detection`、`Aimbo/2026-04 "
"Bosch German&Poland POC`。有权限后再打开该分支。从项目目录运行的公开入口是 [lerobot_ros2 "
"`examples/IsaacSim/README.md`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/lerobot_ros2/blob/main/examples/IsaacSim/README.md)（设置 `LEROBOT_ROOT`"
" 后执行 `motion-generation`）。相机机位留在场景 USD 里。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:106
#: 77cf179e888945fea11685a88ccb0db4
