"    └── labutopia-usd/"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:125
#: 97eb48423c954e11b6e41bd34339c742
msgid ""
"Submodule URLs: [`.gitmodules`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac/blob/main/.gitmodules). Visibility: `submodules_visibility.conf`."
msgstr ""
"子模块地址：[`.gitmodules`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac/blob/main/.gitmodules)。可见性：`submodules_visibility.conf`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:127
#: 35b26ed0cd4a4ae4b21d9744b0e71a4b
msgid "Mimic joints"
msgstr "mimic 关节"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:129
#: 531ab7c8c7ce4aa79e33ee93c46facee
msgid ""
"`tools/audit_mimic_joint_drives.py` reports mimic joints that have no "
"drive. Assets that already use `PhysxMimicJointAPI` or `NewtonMimicAPI` "
"should not gain a second drive: the solver already enforces the mimic, "
"and a drive at `targetPosition=0` fights it. `--apply` is for a mimic "
"that has neither PhysX nor Newton mimic API."
msgstr ""
"`tools/audit_mimic_joint_drives.py` 报告没有驱动的 mimic 关节。已经使用 "
"`PhysxMimicJointAPI` 或 `NewtonMimicAPI` 的资产不要再加第二套驱动：求解器已经在执行 "
"mimic，`targetPosition=0` 的驱动会和它对着干。`--apply` 用于既没有 PhysX 也没有 Newton mimic"
" API 的关节。"

